## example reno script: the P0 vocabulary end to end. `khudson reno vet`
## keeps this honest via TestExampleScriptVets inside the closure build.
demo example-tour
budget 15m

step intro
note intro.md
budget 90s

step editor
note editor.md
budget 4m
launch-session tour-editor --cwd /tmp --keep-focus -- nvim
focus-session tour-editor

step slides
budget 2m
open-url https://example.com/deck
focus-app com.google.Chrome

step wrap
note wrap.md

-- intro.md --
# intro
who i am, what this shows, why it matters.

-- editor.md --
open with the failing test, fix it live.
land the punchline before switching away.

-- wrap.md --
recap the three beats. questions.
